    "summary": "Knife and sheath, the knife with single-edged iron blade and bone handle bound with leather strips, the sheath of carved reindeer bone and leather, formed of two pieces of bone, hollowed and incised on one side with a male figure with pointed hat and stick, leading three reindeer, the other side plain. The two pieces of bone held together with two iron pegs at the curved end and by the leather grip at the pther.The grip formed of one piece of leather sewn together, with a separately attached long loop formed of twisted strips of leather.",
